+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+set -u
+python3 /audit-output/evidence/check_integrity.py

Following the mandated seven-stage audit in order; provenance integrity has passed independently.
  ✓ 1. Verify input/provenance integrity and supplied-semantics identity
  → 2. Check program fidelity, trusted regeneration, and differential behavior
  • 3. Rebuild clean proof definitions and rerun every positive claim
  • 4. Audit theorem adequacy and real-program pinning
  • 5. Inventory and review every semantics/proof rule statically
  • 6. Build and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  • 7. Account proven versus assumed and write REVIEW.md verdict
